thor":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Nu 23:23; Hab 1:5; Ac 2:12,32-36; 3:12-16; 13:40,41; Eph 3:8-11 Col 1:27; 1Ti 3:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-12","title":"Mark 12:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>feared. 11:18,32; Mt 21:26,45,46; Lu 20:6,19; Joh 7:25,30,44 knew. 2Sa 12:7-15; 1Ki 20:38-41; 21:17-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-13","title":"Mark 12:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>they send. Ps 38:12; 56:5,6; 140:5; Isa 29:21; Jer 18:18; Mt 22:15,16; Lu 11:54 Lu 20:20-26 Herodians. 3:6; 8:15; Mt 16:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-14","title":"Mark 12:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Master. 14:45; Ps 12:2-4; 55:21; 120:2; Pr 26:23-26; Jer 42:2,3,20 we know. Joh 7:18; 2Co 2:2,17; 4:1; 5:11; 1Th 2:4 carest. De 33:9,10; 2Ch 18:13; Isa 50:7-9; Jer 15:19-21; Eze 2:6,7; Mic 3:8 2Co 5:16; Ga 1:10; 2:6,11-14 for thou. Ex 23:2-6; De 16:19; 2Ch 19:7 is it. Ezr 4:12,13; Ne 9:37; Mt 17:25-27; 22:17; Lu 20:22; 23:2; Ro 13:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-15","title":"Mark 12:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>knowing. Mt 22:18; Lu 20:23; Joh 2:24,25; 21:17; Heb 4:13; Re 2:23 Why. 10:2; Eze 17:2; Ac 5:9; 1Co 10:9 a penny.\"Valuing of our money, sevenpence halfpenny, as Mt 18:28, marg.\"</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-16","title":"Mark 12:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>image. Mt 22:19-22; Lu 20:24-26; 2Ti 2:19; Re 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-17","title":"Mark 12:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Render. Pr 24:21; Mt 17:25-27; Ro 13:7; 1Pe 2:17 and to. 30; Pr 23:26; Ec 5:4,5; Mal 1:6; Ac 4:19,20; Ro 6:13; 12:1 1Co 6:19,20; 2Co 5:14,15 And they. Job 5:12,13; Mt 22:22,33,46; 1Co 14:24,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-18","title":"Mark 12:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>come. Mt 22:23-33; Lu 20:27-40 say. Ac 4:1,2; 23:6-9; 1Co 15:13-18; 2Ti 2:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-19","title":"Mark 12:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>If. Ge 38:8; De 25:5-10; Ru 4:5 that. Ru 1:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-20","title":"Mark 12:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Mt 22:25-28; Lu 20:29-33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-24","title":"Mark 12:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Do.As the five books of Moses were the only scriptures which the Sadducees admitted as Divine, our Lord confutes them by an appeal to these books, and proves that they were ignorant of those very writings which they professed to hold sacred. He not only rectified their opinions, but so explained the doctrine as to overthrow the erroneous decision of the Pharisees, that if two brothers married one woman, she should be restored at the resurrection to the first.</p>\n<p>Isa 8:20; Jer 8:7-9; Ho 6:6; 8:12; Mt 22:29; Joh 5:39; 20:9; Ac 17:11 Ro 15:4; 2Ti 3:15-17 because. Job 19:25-27; Isa 25:8; 26:19; Eze 37:1-14; Da 12:2; Ho 6:2; 13:14 neither. 10:27; Ge 18:14; Jer 32:17; Lu 1:37; Eph 1:19; Php 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-25","title":"Mark 12:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>but. Mt 22:30; Lu 20:35,36; 1Co 15:42-54; Heb 12:22,23; 1Jo 3:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-26","title":"Mark 12:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>have. 10; Mt 22:31,32 in the book. Ex 3:2-6,16; Lu 20:37; Ac 7:30-32 I am. Ge 17:7,8; 26:24; 28:13; 31:42; 32:9; 33:20; *marg: Isa 41:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-27","title":"Mark 12:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>is not. Ro 4:17; 14:9; Heb 11:13-16 ye. 24; Pr 19:27; Heb 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-28","title":"Mark 12:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>one. Mt 22:34-40 Which. Mt 5:19; 19:18; 23:23; Lu 11:42</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-29","title":"Mark 12:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>Hear. 32,33; De 6:4; 10:12; 30:6; Pr 23:26; Mt 10:37; Lu 10:27; 1Ti 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-31","title":"Mark 12:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>Thou. Le 19:13; Mt 7:12; 19:18,19; 22:39; Lu 10:27,36,37; Ro 13:8,9 1Co 13:4-8; Ga 5:14; Jas 2:8-13; 1Jo 3:17-19; 4:7,8,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-32","title":"Mark 12:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>for. De 4:39; 5:7; 6:4; Isa 44:8; 45:5,6,14,18,21,22; 46:9; Jer 10:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-33","title":"Mark 12:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>is more. 1Sa 15:22; Ps 50:8-15,23; Pr 21:3; Isa 1:11-17; 58:5-7; Jer 7:21-23 Ho 6:6; Am 5:21-24; Mic 6:6-8; Mt 9:13; 12:7; 1Co 13:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-34","title":"Mark 12:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>Thou. Mt 12:20; Ro 3:20; 7:9; Ga 2:19 And no. Job 32:15,16; Mt 22:46; Lu 20:40; Ro 3:19; Col 4:6; Tit 1:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-35","title":"Mark 12:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>while. 11:27; Lu 19:47; 20:1; 21:37; Joh 18:20 How. Mt 22:41,42; Lu 20:41-44; Joh 7:42</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-36","title":"Mark 12:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>by. 2Sa 23:2; Ne 9:30; Mt 22:43-45; Ac 1:16; 28:25; 2Ti 3:16; Heb 3:7,8 Heb 4:7; 1Pe 1:11; 2Pe 1:21 The Lord. Ps 110:1; Ac 2:34-36; 1Co 15:25; Heb 1:13; 10:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-37","title":"Mark 12:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>and whence. Mt 1:23; Ro 1:3,4; 9:5; 1Ti 3:16; Re 22:16 And the. Mt 11:5,25; 21:46; Lu 19:48; 21:38; Joh 7:46-49; Jas 2:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-38","title":"Mark 12:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>said. 4:2 Beware. Mt 10:17; 23:1-7; Lu 20:45-47 which. Mt 6:5; Lu 11:43; 14:7-11; 3Jo 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-39","title":"Mark 12:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>Jas 2:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-40","title":"Mark 12:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>devour. Eze 22:25; Mic 2:2; 3:1-4; Mt 23:14; Lu 20:47; 2Ti 3:6 long. Mt 6:7; 11:22-24; 23:33; Lu 12:47,48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-41","title":"Mark 12:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>sat. Mt 27:6; Lu 21:2-4; Joh 8:20 money.\"A piece of brass money, see Mt 10:9.\"</p>\n<p>the treasury. 2Ki 12:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-42","title":"Mark 12:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>two mites.\"It is the seventh part of one piece of that brass money.\"</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-43","title":"Mark 12:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>That. Ex 35:21-29; Mt 10:42; Ac 11:29; 2Co 8:2,12; 9:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-12-44","title":"Mark 12:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>cast in of. 14:8; 1Ch 29:2-17; 2Ch 24:10-14; 31:5-10; 35:7,8; Ezr 2:68,69 Ne 7:70-72; 2Co 8:2,3; Php 4:10-17 all her. De 24:6; Lu 8:43; 15:12,30; 21:2-4; 1Jo 3:17</p>"}]}